      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Since I made good use of sub animator parameter drivers to make interesting (and useful) animations - notably my dodging game and an in-game keyboard. These animations primarily used movement to activate a parameter driver.\nIt would be great if there was a replacement for this. I need a way to detect movements (or button presses on an external menu) to change a parameter.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
